Description: pinctrl: imx: add the i.MX21 driver in Rust
 Linux dropped this with the board files too. Its table is the one the C driver had. It registers
 at device_initcall, not arch_initcall: what needs it earlier defers. It can be unbound through sysfs.
Author: John Merchant <john@johnmerchant.dev>
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [AI generated code]
Signed-off-by: John Merchant <john@johnmerchant.dev>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01B1fN5HecVTggWQg4Zt8Srt
---
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pinctrl/fsl,imx27-iomuxc.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pinctrl/fsl,imx27-iomuxc.yaml
@@ -4,7 +4,7 @@
